# What is not ours, and is not distributed by us

Minecraft is the property of Mojang Studios and Microsoft. It is **not** included
in this repository or in any installer we publish. The launcher downloads the
game at install time from Mojang's own distribution servers, and using it is
governed by the Minecraft End User Licence Agreement, not by this notice. We
claim no rights over it and we do not redistribute it.

The same applies to the Fabric loader and to the third-party mods that the
launcher installs: they are fetched from their own upstream sources at install
time, and each remains under its own author's licence. We do not redistribute
them and claim no rights over them.

# Third-party components we do distribute

The launcher embeds third-party libraries, which we do redistribute inside the
installers. Their licence notices are reproduced in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md, which
is installed alongside the application.

# Questions

Any question about ownership, permission or licensing of anything in this
repository should be directed to Easter LTD before the material is reused.
